{"text": " as if evil is winning, there is anger here. Let's keep reading in the Psalm. How can we sing the Lord's song on foreign soil? So they're now in Babylon. I sat down down by the waters of Babylon. How can I sing what I used to sing in the temple? How can I sing it here? If I forget you, Jerusalem, may my right hand forget its skill. May my tongue stick to the roof of my mouth. If I do not remember you, if I do not exalt Jerusalem as my greatest joy. This is God's word. He's played.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.84, "text": " as if evil is winning, there is anger here.", "tokens": [50365, 382, 498, 6724, 307, 8224, 11, 456, 307, 10240, 510, 13, 50557], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1521439195490208, "compression_ratio": 1.6761565836298933, "no_speech_prob": 1.2065528697674521e-12}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 4.22, "end": 5.34, "text": " Let's keep reading in the Psalm.", "tokens": [50576, 961, 311, 1066, 3760, 294, 264, 34134, 13, 50632], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1521439195490208, "compression_ratio": 1.6761565836298933, "no_speech_prob": 1.2065528697674521e-12}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 6.140000000000001, "end": 9.36, "text": " How can we sing the Lord's song on foreign soil?", "tokens": [50672, 1012, 393, 321, 1522, 264, 3257, 311, 2153, 322, 5329, 6704, 30, 50833], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1521439195490208, "compression_ratio": 1.6761565836298933, "no_speech_prob": 1.2065528697674521e-12}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 9.48, "end": 10.620000000000001, "text": " So they're now in Babylon.", "tokens": [50839, 407, 436, 434, 586, 294, 30278, 13, 50896], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1521439195490208, "compression_ratio": 1.6761565836298933, "no_speech_prob": 1.2065528697674521e-12}, {"id": 4, "seek": 0, "start": 10.74, "end": 12.56, "text": " I sat down down by the waters of Babylon.", "tokens": [50902, 286, 3227, 760, 760, 538, 264, 12975, 295, 30278, 13, 50993], "temperature": 0